From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rhnvrm <hello@rohanverma.net>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:34:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] perf: scan emoji names without regexp match allocations

Match the existing ASCII emoji syntax with a linear scan while preserving non-overlapping matches, nil results, order and duplicates. Add regex-oracle equivalence checks and ordered history benchmarks.

Mattermax-Patch: emoji-name-scan.patch
---
